    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9ae35f8cdbf8de177a1a1eb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们梦想中的祭典才正要开始而已呢！\n我要尽可能地做到更多事情！\n越多越好，一直不停地做下去……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8aa571f0893a797a34b18eac1631c3118e6d01d2d01af7cc7954cf0ff78a321",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1068/storytimeline_501068111.json",
