    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b729b4d2a8292dc35b190434",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为吃过苦，所以有一颗更能体贴人的心，\n对谁都热心地伸出援手的助人大将。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41bbf92c82c927834c7b1215ca6af636b1be99792a6755ece043ee9c9b0ec4fb",
