      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论是跑得快还是跑得慢的孩子，都很开心。\n直到几乎所有的孩子都累了之后……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3881c1e02e6a79219f2025c62a59f1c218118c5be8f8a71e9bdfc7cfc41c0240",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
